name	Vault
desc	This is the Vault of the Bank of Zork, in which there are no doors.
items	stack of zorkmid bills
endroom
room	74	24	76	N	240
name	Room of Red Mist
desc	You are inside a huge crystalline sphere filled with thin red blue white mist. The mist becomes blue white black to the west. You strain to look out through the mist... You see a small room with a sign on the wall, but it is too blurry to read. You look out into a large, dreary room with a great door and a huge table. There is an odd glow to the mist. A strange blurry room is barely visible. An odd sinuous shadow crosses the mist as you look.
items	
exit	WEST	to	75	Room of Blue Mist
endroom
